  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned magic normally forbidden to you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Expanded Arcana<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Add one spell from any class’s spell list to your list of spells known. This is in addition to the number of spells normally gained at each new level in your class. This spells must be at least one level lower than the highest level spell you can cast in that class. Once made, this choice cannot be changed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc125\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
